  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Arithmetic and geometric sequences, their \\( n \\)th terms, and the sums of finite and infinite series.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Sequences & sums",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Arithmetic: \\( a_n=a+(n-1)d \\), sum \\( S_n=\\tfrac{n}{2}(2a+(n-1)d) \\). Geometric: \\( a_n=ar^{\\,n-1} \\); an infinite geometric series sums to \\( \\dfrac{a}{1-r} \\) when \\( |r|<1 \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Arithmetic term",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a+(n-1)d \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Arithmetic sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac{n}{2}(2a+(n-1)d) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Geometric term",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( ar^{\\,n-1} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Infinite sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{a}{1-r},\\ |r|<1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Find the \\( 10 \\)th term of the arithmetic sequence with \\( a=3,\\ d=2 \\). \\[ 3+9\\times2=21. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Find the sum of the infinite geometric series with \\( a=4,\\ r=\\tfrac12 \\). \\[ \\frac{4}{1-\\tfrac12}=8. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The 3rd term of a geometric sequence is 12 and the 6th term is 96. Find the first term and the common ratio. <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>\\(a_3=ar^2=12\\) and \\(a_6=ar^5=96.\\) Divide: \\(r^3=8\\Rightarrow r=2.\\) \\(a=12/r^2=12/4=3.\\) <strong>First term \\(a=3\\), ratio \\(r=2.\\)</strong></div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
